   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "TypeScript/Fastify \u00b7 the only public entry point\nverifies the JWT \u00b7 route table \u00b7 internal routes answer 404\nsession cache + logout \u00b7 GET-answer cache (X-Cache: HIT/MISS)\nconsistent-hash ring (160 vnodes per node) over cache-1..3\nWebSocket tickets \u00b7 GET /api/logs \u00b7 GET /cache/stats",
   "originalText": "TypeScript/Fastify \u00b7 the only public entry point\nverifies the JWT \u00b7 route table \u00b7 internal routes answer 404\nsession cache + logout \u00b7 GET-answer cache (X-Cache: HIT/MISS)\nconsistent-hash ring (160 vnodes per node) over cache-1..3\nWebSocket tickets \u00b7 GET /api/logs \u00b7 GET /cache/stats",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
